{"id":"vorbild","lemma":"Vorbild","pos":"noun","rank":3617,"glosses":["model; exemplar (praiseworthy example)","role model"],"ipa":"/ˈfoːɐ̯ˌbɪlt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6d/De-Vorbild.ogg/De-Vorbild.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Vorbildes","plural":"Vorbilder"},"examples":[{"text":"Du solltest deinen Kindern ein gutes Vorbild sein.","en":"You should set a good example to your children.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40808","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},{"g":"kid","l":"Kind"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Sie war für uns ein ausgezeichnetes Vorbild.","en":"She has been a wonderful role model for us.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"excellent, outstanding","l":"ausgezeichnet"},null]},{"text":"Tom hat kein Vorbild.","en":"Tom doesn't have a role model.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a"},null]},{"text":"Nimm dir Tom zum Vorbild!","en":"You should follow Tom's example.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Du bist ein gutes Vorbild, Tom.","en":"You're a good role model, Tom.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null,null]}]}